    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40344" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπινομ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
